    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MARY: Hello Annie.\nMARY: It's Mary... Mary Kelly.\nDARK ANNIE: Hello, Mary. How's tricks? If you're going to Dutfield Yard be careful • there's a drunk fallen down in the doorway.\nMARY: Thanks, Annie.",
      "DARK ANNIE: If...if., it's money you want, I'm.. I've only got a shilling. If it's t'other... I... I'll do it here.\nGEORDIE: Time enough for pleasure later. It's business first.",
      "DARK ANNIE: Mary... I've been cut, Mary.\nMARY: Sweet Jesus... Help us • c'mon she needs help.",
      "POLLY: Help • you? Since when has anyone given e shit about us? We're poor and\nDARK ANNIE: You just come round and pick up the pieces. Glorified undertakers, that's what you are.",
      "MARY: You sure you won't be having any, Polly?\nPOLLY: I can't be sittin' here all night. Board needs earning."
    ]
